===============================================================================
DERIVED WORK
===============================================================================
Code in the internal directories — frontend/shadcn/templates,
frontend/chartjs/examples and frontend/data/patterns — is written by us and
licensed under the MIT licence in /LICENSE.

It follows conventions established by shadcn/ui (the `cn` utility composed from
clsx + tailwind-merge, and `cva`-based variant definitions) and is typed against
the published typings of Chart.js, TanStack Table, React Hook Form and Zod. All
of those projects are MIT licensed, and this notice provides the attribution
that licence requires.
